Z||000000||1FieroGTRacingInc||05-05-2000||08:22 PM||||One fo the local used car dealership's got a used fieroin todat and i went to look at it ..... and to my suprise on the front facia it had a indy fiero emblem on it ..???...BUT.. It has a L4 in itw/ dual exaust The rear facia at the bottom look just like my 87 GT w/ dual exaust???  On the rear quartet window it has SE on it..??  and it is red, I was under the impression that ALL the Indy's were White..??..  Can someone help me??   here's the vin # 1G2PF37R0GP229755...  i RAN IT THROUGH CAR FAX...  IT DOES'NT SAY *INDY* NOWHERE...  <P>                              Steve||||reg||5
Z||000001||Phantom Rage||05-05-2000||08:57 PM||||I thought they were all white too.  Check out the color of the intake filter box.  I think it is silver as well as the valve cover.  I know this won't tell you much but hey  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Opps almost forgot, for some reason I recall the seats saying indy on them, but not sure.<p>[This message has been edited by Phantom Rage (edited 05-05-2000).]||||reg||7
Z||000002||Old Lar||05-05-2000||09:05 PM||||The 10 digit in the vin (G)indicates it is an 1986, the 5th digit (F)indicates its an SE or a pace car(which was only made in 1984).The 8th digit (R) means it had a 4 cylinder engine.<P>Some one was switching body panels.  One of the potential problems with buying a used Fiero.<P>Thanks to Mark Corbins Fiero Spotter's Guide for vin id translation.||||reg||1
Z||000003||1FieroGTRacingInc||05-05-2000||10:16 PM||||OldLar,   Soo what your saying is that it  IS NOT A INDY??  Thanks for the help guy's..<P>                          Steve||||reg||1
Z||000004||Old Lar||05-06-2000||06:54 AM||||According to the VIN # the car is a 1986 SE coupe which has had some modifications.  The 2001 Indy Pace cars made, were all white with some special trim added to the exteior (aero nose) and engine compartment.||||reg||13
Z||000005||1FieroGTRacingInc||05-06-2000||08:33 PM||||So, from that I can assume that it is a *orig.* Indy front fascia??  But, it's RED..||||reg||1
Z||000006||Old Lar||05-06-2000||08:42 PM||||It called PAINT!  Someone painted the front fascia red, stuck an Indy nose badge, added Indy Pace car Decals, put twin exhaust tips etc.  The car according to the VIN# is an 86 SE.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>If someone is trying to sell it as a Pace car, its called fraud.  Like if I put Corvette decals and trim on my Fiero and sell it as a Pontiac Corvette.||||reg||3
